          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: அமைப்பு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அமைப்பு — amaippu — \"an organisation; a structure\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்த அமைப்பு ஏழைக் குழந்தைகளுக்கு உதவுகிறது. inta amaippu ēḻaik kuḻantaikaḷukku utavukiṟatu. This organisation helps poor children."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a structure: உடலின் அமைப்பு (amaippu), the structure of the body."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அமைப்பு (amaippu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 162 lists Tamil amai, \"to be close, attached, joined, settled\", and amaippu: what is put together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
